    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vindictus: Defying Fate is an action-packed RPG featuring intense combat and thrilling battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/e4186da6fd5d639d0337f83b43497bc2.poster.avif?t=1750143621\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/e4186da6fd5d639d0337f83b43497bc2.webm?t=1750143621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/e4186da6fd5d639d0337f83b43497bc2.mp4?t=1750143621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Hit Counts, Every Action Matters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment can change your destiny.<br>Master perfect dodge, powerful counters, and heavy-hitting strikes to experience unparalleled combat.<br>Explore unique skills and diverse command inputs exclusive to each character, delivering a stylish and fascinating action style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/facff3d553618be8290db42c9217ca81.poster.avif?t=1750143621\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/facff3d553618be8290db42c9217ca81.webm?t=1750143621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/facff3d553618be8290db42c9217ca81.mp4?t=1750143621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Worlds, Memorable Characters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into meticulously designed 3D dungeons and beautifully varied landscapes.<br>Showcase your personality with stunning character costumes and expressive gestures that elevate your gaming experience.<br>Fight fiercely, customize freely, and express yourself vividly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Conquer?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those bold enough to challenge fate will emerge victorious.<br>In this crucial moment, survival is everything.<br>The battlefield calls. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and prepare for battle.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vindictus: Defying Fate is an action-packed RPG featuring intense combat and thrilling battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/e4186da6fd5d639d0337f83b43497bc2.poster.avif?t=1750143621\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/e4186da6fd5d639d0337f83b43497bc2.webm?t=1750143621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/e4186da6fd5d639d0337f83b43497bc2.mp4?t=1750143621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Hit Counts, Every Action Matters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment can change your destiny.<br>Master perfect dodge, powerful counters, and heavy-hitting strikes to experience unparalleled combat.<br>Explore unique skills and diverse command inputs exclusive to each character, delivering a stylish and fascinating action style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/facff3d553618be8290db42c9217ca81.poster.avif?t=1750143621\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/facff3d553618be8290db42c9217ca81.webm?t=1750143621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/facff3d553618be8290db42c9217ca81.mp4?t=1750143621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Worlds, Memorable Characters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into meticulously designed 3D dungeons and beautifully varied landscapes.<br>Showcase your personality with stunning character costumes and expressive gestures that elevate your gaming experience.<br>Fight fiercely, customize freely, and express yourself vividly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Conquer?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those bold enough to challenge fate will emerge victorious.<br>In this crucial moment, survival is everything.<br>The battlefield calls. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and prepare for battle.</p>",
